### Question 1: Cleaning and Transforming

forest area of 80 countries, the four columns

1.  it shows each counties, multiple years, FILTER FOR Anogola, how many and which year to which year are reported, then filter for Belgium, how many years (1pts)

<!-- -->

2)  use one summary table to show Which countries have reports less than 31 years? (2pts)

3)  For 2020 only, what the top 3 counties that have the largest (2pts)

4)  (pivot_wider). Keep only 1990 and 2020 for countries, then make one column per year. (2pts)

5)  (mutate after pivot). Using wide, compute the change from 1990 to 2020, remove countries with NA, and find the country with the biggest decrease. (3pts)

You can complete these tasks in multiple steps or create intermediate results as needed.

::: footnote
Data source: Forests and Deforestation in [Our World in Data](https://ourworldindata.org/forests-and-deforestation). Adapted dataset from [TidyTuesday](https://github.com/cnicault/tidytuesday) [2021-15 Global Deforestation](https://github.com/cnicault/tidytuesday/tree/master/2021/2021-15-global_deforestation).
:::

